  "description": "IL weaver that draws each assertion in a test as a note in its Kronikol diagram and a sub-step in its step list, passed or failed, with the values it compared. It instruments the assertion statements of FluentAssertions and AwesomeAssertions (.Should()) and TUnit (Assert.That()) in the compiled IL, so C# semantics such as null propagation, ref parameters and evaluation order are unchanged. Turn it on with [assembly: TrackAssertions].",
